Website: [url=https://yumina.io]yumina.io[/url]"
	"changenote"		"0.7.0 - Co-op. Talk to your Ancients and the Merchant in multiplayer while the party watches: teammates' lines show on your screen, the characters compare you, can be talked into liking or disliking a teammate, and can give a reward to a friend. Deals, road encounters, the Ancient's shelf and the end-of-run look-back work in co-op too. Everyone needs the same version. With AncientWaifus (LunchShark, Dodobird) and Merchant2CuteII (LinXce) installed, road event paintings and keepsake icons switch to versions drawn after their characters."
